    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Relic of Rebirth.</strong> Your forge can now produce artifacts that drag whole places back from the brink.</p><ul><li>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, you may begin a special forging project to create a <strong>Relic of Rebirth</strong>. This typically requires a full scene, rare materials, and participation from allies (at the GM’s discretion).</li><li>When the Relic is properly installed or activated in a <strong>corrupted, devastated, or severely wounded region/hex</strong>, it triggers a major restorative effect: corruption is cleansed, ruin is reversed, or the hex’s status improves one or more steps as defined by your hex/Resolution/Tikkun rules.</li><li>Mechanically, this feature is your permission slip to <strong>restore one region or hex</strong> per use in a big, visible way, under the GM’s control for exact numbers (Darkness down, Loyalty up, status shifts, modifiers cleared, etc.).</li></ul>",
